		AMD ZynqMP Board Support Package


Table of Contents
=================

1. Supported Boards
2. Change History
3. BSP Features
4. BSP Notes


1. Supported Boards
===================

This BSP supports the following boards:

  + AMD ZYNQMP ZCU102 REV 1.0/1.1


2. Change History
=================

  - 2025/09 (LINUXPG-2606): Add BSP support for ZYNQMP ZCU102 board based on xilinx-sdk-2025.01

3. BSP Features
===============

3.1 Supported Features
----------------------

The following BSP features are validated and supported on boards where
the corresponding h/w features exist.

  o Bus
	+ I2C: On-Chip I2C Controller
	+ Quad-SPI: On-Chip Quad-SPI controller
	+ PCIe: On-Chip PCIe controller
	+ USB 2.0: Host/Gadget
	+ USB 3.0: Host/Gadget/OTG

  o Network
	+ CAN: On-Chip CAN controller
	+ Ethernet: GEM Ethernet Controllers
	+ PHY: TI DP83867IRPAP Ethernet RGMII PHY

  o Storage
	+ QSPI NOR Flash: N25Q512A 128MB
	+ EEPROM: M24C08
	+ SATA: On-Chip SATA controller
	+ SD/MMC: On-Chip SD/SDIO/eMMC Controller

  o Power Mgmt
	+ CPU hotplug
	+ CPU IDLE: WFI mode
	+ CPU Frequency

  o Misc Devices
	+ DMA Engine: General purpose DMA controller
	+ RTC: On-Chip Real Time Clock unit
	+ UART: On-Chip UART Controller
	+ SYSMON:
		+ PMBUS Monitor INA226
		+ On-Chip Monitor AMS

  o Graphic
	+ GPU: ARM Mali-400 MP2(r8p0-01rel0)
	+ Display: VESA DisplayPort 1.2

  o Security
	+ AES: ZynqMP AES-GCM engine
	+ RSA: ZynqMP RSA engine
	+ SHA: ZynqMP SHA-3 engine

3.2 Limited Supported Features
------------------------------

  o Network
	+ FPGA CANFD: Based on Xilinx CANFD v3.0 logiCORE IP

3.3 Unsupported Features
------------------------

The following features are not supported and not validated:

  x HPC0, HPC1 ports
  x Two HDMI ports
  x 2x2 SFP/SFP+ ports
  x IOMMU: SMMU Memory Management (SMMU-500)
  x SPI: On-Chip SPI controller
  x NAND: On-Chip NAND controller
  x DDR-EDAC: DDR Error Detection And Correction
  x OCRAM-EDAC: OCRAM Error Detection And Correction
  x RemotePROC: inter-process communications between APUs and RPUs

4. BSP Notes
============

4.1 Validated Board Info
------------------------

This BSP is only validated in following environment. If you use this BSP
in a different environment it may possibly have some issues.

	Processor:              ZYMQMP (410fd034 revision 4, Chip ID: xczu9eg)
	Board Revision:	        Rev 1.0/1.1
	BootLoader:             U-Boot
	BootLoader Version:     U-Boot 2025.01
